data: {"type": "result", "answer": {"response": "Based on the provided metadata, the recorded direct profile relationships for extrusion with object ID 'solid' include the following attributes:\n\n- **Document ID**: A unique identifier assigned to each document, typically used for reference and tracking purposes. Sample values: test-document.\n- **Revision**: The revision number of the object, represented as an integer. Sample values: 2.\n- **Endpoint IDs (source-to-target order)**: Not explicitly identified in the metadata provided.\n- **Direction**: The direction of the operation or transformation, represented as text. Sample values: profile-to-extrude.\n- **Mode**: The operational mode of the object, represented as text. Sample values: live.\n- **Status**: The current state or resolution of an item or task, represented as text. Sample values: resolved.\n- **Missing Flag**: An integer value indicating the presence or absence of data. Sample values: 0.\n- **Sketch Owners**: A list of owners associated with the source and target sketches, represented as text. Sample values: [].\n\nThe metadata does not explicitly provide endpoint IDs in source-to-target order or the exact document ID and revision for the extrusion with object ID 'solid'.", "sql_code": "", "sql_columns": [], "custom_analyses_used": [], "sql_response_from_db": null}}

